WEBVTT

00:00.320 --> 00:01.480
What nonsense

00:01.560 --> 00:02.720
The imperial seal

00:02.800 --> 00:05.040
Has always been in the Sikong family's hands

00:05.120 --> 00:06.520
Although by convention

00:06.720 --> 00:08.720
Envoys are not killed in war

00:09.280 --> 00:11.080
But such malicious words

00:11.680 --> 00:13.080
I cannot spare you

00:14.120 --> 00:14.680
Zhu Yuanzhi

00:14.760 --> 00:15.680
Here

00:15.760 --> 00:17.160
Cut off his head

00:18.240 --> 00:19.640
Throw it back to Shilang

00:19.720 --> 00:21.120
Yes

00:21.240 --> 00:22.520
Drag him away

00:22.600 --> 00:23.120
Your Highness

00:23.280 --> 00:23.960
Your Highness

00:24.040 --> 00:25.800
Shilang really has the imperial seal

00:25.880 --> 00:27.280
Your Highness

00:54.800 --> 00:56.200
General

00:57.480 --> 00:59.147
This is Chu Maolun's head

01:16.760 --> 01:17.960
Any other Xuan tricks

01:18.040 --> 01:19.440
You're used to

01:19.560 --> 01:20.920
Think harder

01:21.000 --> 01:21.640
Or

01:21.720 --> 01:23.387
Say your last words now

01:23.960 --> 01:24.640
General

01:24.720 --> 01:25.440
General

01:25.520 --> 01:26.720
There's another plan

01:26.800 --> 01:28.040
As I know

01:28.120 --> 01:29.400
The Wuyang commander Chen Ying

01:29.480 --> 01:30.280
Is backed by

01:30.360 --> 01:31.120
Xuan Kingdom's Prince of Ning

01:31.280 --> 01:32.600
Who doesn't get along with Prince of Jin

01:32.680 --> 01:34.360
We can spread the false news that Prince of Jin

01:34.440 --> 01:35.840
Got the seal

01:36.040 --> 01:37.000
To

01:37.080 --> 01:38.480
Wuyang

01:39.080 --> 01:40.200
Good dog

01:40.280 --> 01:41.440
Good dog

01:41.520 --> 01:42.920
You'll be rewarded

01:43.000 --> 01:43.720
Thank you, General

01:43.800 --> 01:44.280
Thank you, General

01:44.360 --> 01:45.680
Do as he says

01:45.760 --> 01:47.360
Also have those who came line up

01:47.520 --> 01:48.400
Yes
